om/es/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/54-45.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Al-Qamar 54:45 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Yakında o topluluk yenilecek ve arkalarını dönerek kaçacaklardır.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/54.html\">Sûre Al-Qamar</a> › Âyet 45</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Al-Qamar 54:45</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿سَيُهْزَمُ الْجَمْعُ وَيُوَلُّونَ الدُّبُرَ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Yakında o topluluk yenilecek ve arkalarını dönerek kaçacaklardır.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">من الغيب في حال ضعف الإسلام، واستبعاد عامة الناس ذلك<cite>«النبوات» 2/964</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s54a45\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\